# Most Valuable Slayer: "Whenever you attack, target attacking creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn" (CR 508.3d,
# 115.1, 611.2a). Bot1 attacks with the Slayer and an Ornithopter; the one trigger cannot target Bot2's Ornithopter, which is not attacking
# (CR 508.1k). It gives the Ornithopter +1/+0 (1/2) and first strike, so Bot2 takes 2 + 1 = 3. The pump and the keyword
# are gone when the turn is over (the Ornithopter flies by itself).

